  <!-- LB-3D-HERO -->
  <canvas id="heroCanvas" hidden aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <div class="hero-bg"></div>
  <div class="hero-shade"></div>
  <div class="hero-in">
    <div class="hero-copy">
    <p class="hero-kicker">Tree services — Newcastle · Maitland · the Hunter</p>
    <h1>Dangerous trees,<br><span class="acc">handled</span><br>properly.<br><span class="thin">Removal · Pruning · Stump grinding · 24/7 emergency</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Tree removal, health pruning, deadwooding, canopy shaping and stump grinding across Newcastle, Maitland and the Hunter — plus 24/7 storm response. Safe rigging, a clear price and every site left raked clean.</p>
