      <p><strong>24/7 emergency</strong>when a tree comes down</p>
      <p><strong>Newcastle &amp; Maitland</strong>local Hunter coverage</p>
      <p><strong>Free quotes</strong>clear pricing, no surprises</p>
    </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>



<section id="services"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-idx">01</span><div><h2 class="sec-title">Tree work done properly, every time.</h2><p class="lead">From a dangerous removal to a tidy prune — the right method, the right gear and a crew that cleans up behind itself.</p></div></div>
  <div class="svc-grid"><div class="svc-row rv"><span class="svc-n">01</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Tree removal</h3><p>Safe felling and sectional dismantling, including tight and dangerous trees beside houses, sheds and powerlines.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div><div class="svc-row rv"><span class="svc-n">02</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Pruning &amp; deadwooding</h3><p>Our tree health pruning, deadwood removal and canopy shaping work helps produce stronger, safer trees and lets in better light.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div><div class="svc-row rv"><span class="svc-n">03</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Stump grinding</h3><p>Stump grinding leaves the stump below ground level, giving you an area that is ready for mowing and clean replanting.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div><div class="svc-row rv"><span class="svc-n">04</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>24/7 emergency response</h3><p>Storm damage and fallen trees — call any hour and we respond to make the site safe.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div><div class="svc-row rv"><span class="svc-n">05</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Safe work practices</h3><p>Proper rigging, PPE and job planning on every site — the method suits the tree, not the other way around.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div><div class="svc-row rv"><span class="svc-n">06</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Full clean-up</h3><p>Everything chipped, removed and raked — the yard is left tidy and ready to use.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div></div>
</div></section>

<section class="band" id="process"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-idx">02</span><div><h2 class="sec-title">One crew from the first call to the final clean-up.</h2></div></div>
  <div class="steps"><div class="step rv"><span class="step-n">01</span><div><h3>Call or message</h3><p>Describe the job and send a photo — it helps us quote faster.</p></div></div><div class="step rv"><span class="step-n">02</span><div><h3>Free assessment &amp; quote</h3><p>On-site look with a clear price and a date, before anything is cut.</p></div></div><div class="step rv"><span class="step-n">03</span><div><h3>The tree work</h3><p>Safe, efficient work by an experienced Hunter crew.</p></div></div><div class="step rv"><span class="step-n">04</span><div><h3>Clean-up</h3><p>Debris chipped and removed, the yard raked and left ready to use.</p></div></div></div>
</div></section>

<section id="faq"><div class="wrap faq-wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-idx">03</span><div><h2 class="sec-title">Asked on every tree job.</h2></div></div>
  <details class="faq rv"><summary>Do you do emergency call-outs?</summary><div class="a">Yes — 24/7 for storm damage and fallen trees across Newcastle, Maitland and the Hunter.</div></details><details class="faq rv"><summary>Which areas do you cover?</summary><div class="a">Newcastle, Maitland and the wider Hunter region in NSW.</div></details><details class="faq rv"><summary>Can you get to tight or dangerous trees?</summary><div class="a">Yes — sectional dismantling and rigging for trees over houses, sheds and fences.</div></details><details class="faq rv"><summary>Do you clean up afterwards?</summary><div class="a">Always — everything is chipped, removed and raked before we leave.</div></details>
</div></section>

<section class="stat-band band" id="stats"><div class="wrap"><div class="stat rv d1"><b>24/7</b><span>Emergency response</span></div><div class="stat rv d2"><b>Hunter</b><span>Newcastle & Maitland</span></div><div class="stat rv d3"><b>Below grade</b><span>Stump grinding</span></div><div class="stat rv d4"><b>Free</b><span>On-site quotes</span></div></div></section>

<section id="trust"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-idx">04</span><div><h2 class="sec-title">Why the Hunter calls Dale first.</h2></div></div>
  <div class="trust-strip"><div class="tr-i rv d1"><div class="tr-t">&#10003;</div><div><b>24/7 emergency</b><span>Trees do not fall on schedule</span></div></div><div class="tr-i rv d2"><div class="tr-t">&#10003;</div><div><b>Newcastle &amp; Maitland</b><span>Local Hunter coverage</span></div></div><div class="tr-i rv d3"><div class="tr-t">&#10003;</div><div><b>Removal to maintenance</b><span>One-off jobs or ongoing care</span></div></div><div class="tr-i rv d4"><div class="tr-t">&#10003;</div><div><b>Fair, clear pricing</b><span>Quoted before we start</span></div></div></div>
</div></section>

<section id="work"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><div class="sec-idx">05</div><div><h2 class="rv d1">On the saw.</h2><p class="lead rv d2">Removals, pruning and stump work across Newcastle, Maitland and surrounds.</p></div></div>
</div>
